Context: A case was opened with a short description of [Patch][CLI] OptionBuilder implemented like ToStringBuilder from commons-lang

A longer description includes OptionBuilder uses only static methods instead of a very common java-idiom, the
chain of calls, that is used in many jakarta projects (see ECS or commons-lang
with the implementations of ToStringBuilder, HashCodeBuilder...)

This patch fixes OptionBuilder but as it breaks the current API, it might be
best applied on a 2.0 release.

Ludovic.

